// Candlelight seen through the holes, plus the pool of light on the ground.
// mid: flame upright. left/right: the flame leans and the hot side moves
// (right is left flipped). dim: the flame gutters. flare: an agent needs
// you. Every step lasts at least 200 ms, so the idle loop has at most
// 2.5 light-dark pairs per second (WCAG 2.3.1 allows 3).
size 32x28
origin 14 18

frame mid
..ssd......................dss..
.ssdddd..................ddddss.
sddddddff..............ffdddddds
sddddddfff............fffdddddds
.dddddffff............ffffddddd.
..ddfffff..............fffffdd..
....ffff................ffff....
................................
...............ff...............
..............fggf..............
................................
................................
sdd..........................dds
.ddfff....................fffdd.
..ddffff...fggghggggf...ffffdd..
...dffff..fgggghhggggf..ffffd...
.....fffffggggghhgggggfffff.....
........ffggggggggggggff........
...........fggggggggf...........
................................
................................
................................
................................
................................
.......eerrrrrrrrrrrrrree.......
..........weeeeeeeeeew..........
.............wwwwww.............
................................

frame left
..sdd......................sss..
.sddddf..................dddsss.
dddddffff..............fdddddsss
ddddddffff............ffddddddss
.ddddfffff............fffdddddd.
..dffffff..............ffffddd..
....ffff................fffd....
................................
...............gf...............
..............gggf..............
................................
................................
