.dffff....................ffddd.
..dffffg...ggghgggfff...fffddd..
...fffff..gggghhgggfff..fffdd...
.....ffffggggghhgggggffffff.....
........fgggggggggggggff........
...........gggggggggf...........
................................
................................
................................
................................
................................
......eerrrrrrrrrrrrrree........
.........weeeeeeeeeew...........
............wwwwww..............
................................

