.dddff....................ffffd.
..dddfff...fffggghggg...gffffd..
...ddfff..fffggghhgggg..fffff...
.....ffffffggggghhgggggffff.....
........ffgggggggggggggf........
...........fggggggggg...........
................................
................................
................................
