..aas......................saa..
.aassss..................ssssaa.
asssssssd..............dsssssssa
assssssddd............dddssssssa
.sssssdddd............ddddsssss.
..ssddddd..............dddddss..
....dddd................dddd....
................................
...............dd...............
..............dffd..............
................................
................................
ass..........................ssa
.ssddd....................dddss.
..ssdddd...dfffgffffd...ddddss..
...sdddd..dffffhgffffd..dddds...
.....dddddfffffhgfffffddddd.....
........ddfffffggfffffdd........
...........dffffffffd...........
................................
................................
................................
................................
................................
.........eeeeeeeeeeeeee.........
............wwwwwwww............
